            "review_title": "Review at Things Cafe",
            "review_text": "1313RichardD1313\nDüsseldorf, Germany134 contributions\n0\nGreat little local cafe with excellent Cappuccino\nDec 2014 • Couples\nWe discovered this unsassuming little cafe walking towards the citadel from the old quarter and were extremely impressed with the young local owner and his capabilities with an excellent modern italian coffee machine to make amazing cappuccinos. \nWe tend to go local on food and drink wherever we are but really appreciate a good cappuccino once in awhile and this young guy really impressed and put a lot of attention to detail into what seems to be more of a passion for him.\nIt was also a very nice little cafe to sit in and had fast free wifi like we found quite often.\nWe tried quite a few Cappuccinos in Hanoi and elsewhere in SE Asia and can very much recommend this young entrepreneur and his coffees. He seems to have had some pretty good and authentic training before he started up.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 11, 2015",
